## Context

Split from ticket 1332 (2026-10-29) so that 1332 can close at merge: its
after-measurement needs 20 gaze runs on the new structure, which only exist
after the merge (Monitor, in Trust, Verify, Monitor).

## Intent

Once 20 gaze runs have completed on the structure 1332 landed, compare against
1332's Step 0 baseline with the same scripts and endpoints
(`scripts/gaze_wall_time.py`, `scripts/gaze_wall_analysis.py`,
`gaze_wall_time.endpoints`). If 1332 closed as no-go, close this ticket with a
pointer to it.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Setup and closing medians, call counts and model time per turn, n and cut, against the Step 0 baseline recorded in 1332's log
- [ ] Reported here even if the gain is nil; a slowdown per turn that eats the saving reopens 1332
